    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhayo gwa ng'wa SEEBA kū Baisilaeli mu nzīla ya ng'wa Malaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Seeba kūntogwa Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akūhayaga gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esau walī atī nkūlūye wa ng'wa Yakobo? Alīhaya SEEBA. Alīyo ū Yakobo h'ūyo nantogilwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lelo ū Esau nūnkolwa, nī ngūlū jakwe naajigalūcha jūbiza itogolo dalali, ū wingīji bokwe nūbūlekela manyamhawa ga mu matogolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Edomu ng'wene ni ahayage dūhū ī gīkī, “Nūūlū īkī tūkakenangujiwa ī sī yise, alīyo nahene tūkwīzenga hangī dūhū ī misaka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū SEEBA wa Būdūla bose alīhaya gīkī, “Ū kūzenga ni bazengage, alīyo nakūkambagūla. Bakwitanwa Sī Yabūbi, banhū abo balī mu būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA pyī ī shikū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū mukūgūbona na miso ging'we; mukubyuhaya gīkī, “Ū SEEBA ng'wene ntaale nū kū sī ja hanze ya Isilaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha shitigeleelilwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wana akbizaga ankūgije ū ise, nū ntūmami ūyo wantūūla ha nīmo. Al'ū nene ūlū nalī sīng'we, līlī halī lūūlū ī likūjo īlo līniigeleelilwe? Alahaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose. A bing'we bagabīji h'abo mukoolekejaga ibengwe ū kū lina lyane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo mukūbūūjaga, “Toolekije ibengwe mu kinehe ū kū lina lyako?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūtūūlaga shilīwa shisosohalile a ha ng'walīlo gwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū kūnū ng'ūbūja, “Tūkūkūsosohajaga mu nzīla kī?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa kūhaya gīkī ī meza ya ng'wa SEEBA yene ya kwibengelejiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ūlū mulenha mitugo jibbokulile gīkī shitambò kūlwa nguno yane, ū gwenūyo gūtī mhayo gwa bubi ū gwenūyo? Ūlū mulīfunya mitugo jilemehalile nūūlū jisaatile gīkī jibize shitambò, gūtī gwa bubi ū gwenūyo? Aligemagi ū kūjifunya kūlwa ntemi wing'we! Akūmuyegela? Akūng'wanukūla dūhū? Alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wikūmbīlījagi lūūlū ī haha ū Mulungu atūchīle shigongo. A bing'we muliganika akūng'wanukūla na shakwinha shilī gīko mu nkono ging'we? Alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hambū hambū ni wigela ūmò wing'we wīlugala ī milyango ya hekalu, mutizikala mukūbachaga myoto ītī na ngofyolo ha ng'walīlo gwane! Mutūniyejaga biya. Alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose, nīyo natanukūla shakwinha kūfuma mu makono ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwandīja būfuma līīmi kūshika būgwa līīmi, ī lina lyane līkūjiwe no ū mu mahanaga. Būlī kwene shikūfunyiagwa shakwinha sha ng'waso nsoga na shitambò sheela nguno ya lina lyane, kūlwa ngun ī lina lyane līkūjiwe no ū mu mahanga. Alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we mukūlīsosohajaga kūlwa kwīhaya ī meza ya ng'wa SEEBA gīkī, “Ī yenīyo nsoso,” nī shilīwa shayo gīkī, “Ī shenīsho sh'ibengwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wakūyīīta ng'wahaya, “Ī lyenīlo līnigo dūhū nīyo! Hūna ng'wayūshinunhya mu kūshiibengeleja.” Alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'wanenhela mitugo jilabūkile, nūlū nemehazu, nūūlū jisaatile gīkī mujifunye shitambò, najanukūle dūhū ū mu makono ging'we? Alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī ng'ondi yawiza ng'widaale lyakwe ūlū ūlahīla kwīfunya shitambò kūlī SEEBA, alīyo huna ūfunya shitambò sha ntugo gūlemehalile, ū ng'wenūyo nomolomo hangī azumile. Nguno ū nene nalī ntemi ntaale. Alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose, nīyo ī lina lyane shiigelile koogohwa ū mu mahanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
